msgctxt "693\t771"
msgid "You again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784\t852"
msgid "Just the guy I wanted to see!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "853\t919"
msgid "Where's Nakahara!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1295\t1378"
msgid "Easy, boy. Don't get antsy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1379\t1508"
msgid "Lemme enjoy this reunion a bit first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1686\t1962"
msgid ""
"You know, when Mine told me we'd be meeting again...\\n"
"I got goosebumps from head to toe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972\t2032"
msgid "And Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2033\t2093"
msgid "Where is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2153\t2289"
msgid "Long gone by now. To Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2380\t2525"
msgid ""
"My only job was wrecking that\\n"
"shithole of an orphanage you run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2548\t2674"
msgid "Oh, and keeping you pinned down here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2744\t2899"
msgid ""
"If you die here, the Hakuho'll\\n"
"make me a billionaire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2900\t3108"
msgid ""
"And if I wipe out the Ryudo too,\\n"
"Okinawa'll be mine and mine alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3109\t3169"
msgid "Bastard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3189\t3279"
msgid "Now, we got all the time in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3280\t3388"
msgid "Let's have a little fun, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3716\t3776"
msgid "Nakahara!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3802\t3863"
msgid "Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3925\t3988"
msgid "Pretty picture, ain't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3989\t4148"
msgid "An old bullshitter taking on some old bulls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4163\t4247"
msgid "The irony's killing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4251\t4362"
msgid "Tamashiro!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4406\t4466"
msgid "Not so fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4494\t4671"
msgid ""
"You might not know, but bulls are\\n"
"real sensitive to the sound of gunfire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4719\t4919"
msgid ""
"One little \"pop\" from this thing,\\n"
"and they'll tear your buddy, Nakahara, to bits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4944\t5025"
msgid "So whaddya say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5097\t5195"
msgid "Let's just forget about Nakahara for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5206\t5428"
msgid ""
"He'll have plenty of playtime with his new pals\\n"
"once you're out of the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5762\t5825"
msgid "Not happenin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5853\t5913"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6081\t6201"
msgid ""
"Sorry 'bout this, Aniki!\\n"
"Don't get mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6202\t6263"
msgid "The little lady..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6264\t6358"
msgid "I caught her sneakin' here all on her own!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6359\t6419"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6437\t6497"
msgid "Saki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6583\t6685"
msgid ""
"The hell you want,\\n"
"another bullet in the leg!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6686\t6804"
msgid "Tamashiro! The cops are on their way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6805\t6923"
msgid ""
"In ten minutes they'll have every last\\n"
"corner of this place covered!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6929\t6986"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6987\t7167"
msgid ""
"A two-bit thug like you... You'll never\\n"
"compete with Nakahara or Kiryu-aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7168\t7232"
msgid "You little shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7243\t7306"
msgid "I get it now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7307\t7474"
msgid ""
"You must reeeally wanna watch\\n"
"your beloved patriarch bite the dust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7556\t7639"
msgid "Fine. If you want it that bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660\t7736"
msgid "I'd be glad to oblige!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7950\t8125"
msgid ""
"Nakahara! It's the end of the line\\n"
"for you and your chickenshit Ryudo boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8293\t8316"
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8317\t8377"
msgid "Nakahara!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8731\t8804"
msgid "Dad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8864\t8924"
msgid "Saki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8934\t9041"
msgid "Dad, look out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9501\t9539"
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9540\t9582"
msgid "Nakahara!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9583\t9645"
msgid "The fuck?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9714\t9868"
msgid "Tamashiro! I haven't felt this good in years!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9904\t10059"
msgid ""
"It's like I'm a kid again,\\n"
"rulin' this town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10088\t10154"
msgid "Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10182\t10280"
msgid "Kiryu... I'll be fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10276\t10354"
msgid "Handle him for me, will ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10355\t10415"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10579\t10630"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10631\t10660"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10661\t10746"
msgid "How long until the cops show up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10747\t10793"
msgid "Seven or eight minutes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10794\t10839"
msgid "Great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10840\t10974"
msgid ""
"That should be just enough time\\n"
"to take out the trash here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10975\t11035"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11039\t11145"
msgid ""
"But only just.\\n"
"There's no time to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11181\t11274"
msgid "We'll need to make this quick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11314\t11374"
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11394\t11524"
msgid "Go on, men! Fuck 'em up!"
msgstr ""